			"Message": "style(Mountain): Collapse ValidatePermission function signature to single line\n\nConsolidate the multi-line parameter list of `ValidatePermission::Fn` into a single-line function signature, following the same code-style pass applied across the Environment subsystem in the preceding commit.\n\nPure formatting change — no semantic or logic changes to permission validation.",
