			"Message": "style(Mountain): Tidy formatting across Environment subsystem\n\nConsolidate multi-line import blocks into single lines in all four LanguageFeatureProvider feature method files (InvokeProvider, InvokeProviderMethod, ProvideHover, ProvideOnTypeFormattingEdits). Add consistent blank-line separators between match arms throughout WhenClause.rs — tokenizer character dispatch, parser expression handling, and evaluator branches. Reflow SearchProvider.rs closures and chained calls for readability; collapse FileWatcherIgnore test assertion to one line; reflow ConnectPipeServerAdapter and SpawnExecutableAdapter error-format strings to avoid 100-char overhang.\n\nPure code-style pass over the Source/Environment/ tree — no semantic or logic changes.",
			"SHA": "3ab438005c3290c5955d13ed0b5c19fb777f949b"
		},
